{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"提摩太前書","commonName":"提摩太前書","title":"提摩太前書","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1822fdddb64d09dc14c1e74356eb9c5a0d478ee65d890e82de816027d13aa2d2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["要為他人禱告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我勸你首先要為所有的人懇求、禱告、代求和感謝上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["也要為所有的君王和掌權者禱告，使我們可以懷著虔誠、端正的心過和平安寧的生活。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["這樣做很美好，是蒙我們的救主上帝悅納的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為祂願世人都得救，明白真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝只有一位，在上帝和世人之間只有一位中保，就是降世為人的基督耶穌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["祂捨命作所有人的贖價，這在所定的時候已顯明出來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["為此，我被指派做傳道人和使徒，教導外族人認識信仰和真理。我說的是實話，並非謊言。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["信徒的操守"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我願男人舉起聖潔的手隨處禱告，不發怒，不爭辯",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我願女人衣著得體，樸素端莊，不靠髮型、珠寶金飾或名貴衣服來妝飾自己，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["要有善行，這樣才配稱為敬畏上帝的女人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女人應當安安靜靜地學習，完全順服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我不准女人教導或管轄男人，她們應當保持安靜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為先造的是亞當，後造的是夏娃，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["並非亞當受騙，而是夏娃受騙陷入罪中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["不過，女人如果持守信心和愛心，聖潔自律，就必在生育的事上得救。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「爭辯」或譯「疑惑」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}